## 12.  Common Pitfalls

| Problem | Why it breaks | Fix |
|---------|---------------|-----|
| Blocking the executor (`thread::sleep`, `std::fs::read`) | Blocks the thread, stalls all tasks | Use `tokio::time::sleep` or `spawn_blocking` |
| Mixing `std::sync::Mutex` with async code | Deadlocks, poor performance | Use `tokio::sync::Mutex` |
| Forgetting `await` on a future | Future never runs | Add `.await` or use `.block_on` in `main` |
| Spawning too many tasks in a tight loop | Out‑of‑memory, scheduler thrashing | Throttle with a semaphore or use `FuturesUnordered` |
| Using `async_trait` with `Send` + `Sync` restrictions | Lifetime issues | Ensure the trait bounds match your runtime |

